.TH start-cli-tunnel-device-show-config 1  "show-config "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-tunnel\-device\-show\-config \- Show WireGuard configuration for device
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli tunnel device show\-config\fR [\fB\-\-endpoint\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISUBNET\fR> <\fIIP\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show WireGuard configuration for device
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-endpoint\fR \fI<HOST>\fR
IPv4, IPv6, or DNS endpoint host for this WireGuard config; required when the selected WAN IP is not public
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISUBNET\fR>

.TP
<\fIIP\fR>

